[ext_resource type="Resource" path="res://config/tv_director_12nov.tres" id="4"]

; The TV director set to the real World Tour slalom stream (TvDirectorConfig, TvStreamDirector; the
; report: Documentation/reports/broadcast/tv_director_stream.md). Where the numbers come from:
; - MEASURED (Documentation/reports/broadcast/data/stream_profile.json, nine slalom heats, 393 beats):
;   every picture's weight_pct (its share of the phase's time), sail_pct and horizon_pct (the quartiles
;   of the sail's height and the horizon's place, percent of the picture's height), each phase's take_s
;   (the quartiles of the take lengths; before the start and after the race of the live pictures only,
;   the profile's take_length_action) and longest_s; mark_take_s (the profile's mark_beat);
;   finish_take_s (its drone side-on at the line in the race); the start's phase borders (-10 s, +12 s).
; - COUNTED tonight on the nine heats' start sequences (the readers' shot_notes.csv around the gun):
;   line_drone_before_gun_s (the line drone came 2.6, 3.1, 3.7 s before the gun: p25, middle, p75),
;   runner_after_gun_s (the drone running with the fleet came, or the line drone began to run, 0.6,
;   0.7, 1.8 s after it; runner_latest_s 5: the latest of the nine was 4.7), runner_take_s (it ran
;   8.0, 9.6, 11.6 s); the runners were 4 of 9 behind-side
;   on the fleet, 4 ahead-side on the front, 1 side: start_runners' weights (the ahead-side one's
;   weight is the start's drone front_side front share plus the following part of its front_side
;   line share, its framing the start's front_side front picture).
; - FROM THE READERS' DIRECTOR NOTES (words, not counts): mark_cut_before_s (2 to 5 s), the mark's hold
;   between 4 and 16 s, finish_cut_before_s (2 to 5 s), the finish's hold up to 30 s, the winner's
;   close-up after the race (20 to 30 s, sail 55 to 70 %).
; - THE GAME'S CHOICE (not measured; the reason in TvDirectorConfig): the drones' lens_deg (a
;   lens of 47 degrees of vertical view for every drone: a camera drone's standard wide lens, chosen
;   inside the range of 47 to 59 degrees the lead measured on four passes, drone_position.md; the
;   distances and heights then follow from the framing); angle_deg round the board (45 for
;   behind-side, 90 side, 135 front-side: the middle of each view; the readers agreed on the side for
;   only 58 % of the seconds); chasers_at_mark_chance 0.7 and finish_follow_through_chance 0.5 (the
;   notes say "often" and show both about equally); mark_after_rounding_s; mark_near_m (the gybe
;   done once the board has come within 25 m of the buoy and goes away again); chasers_within_s;
;   lead_group_m and lead_group_most (the readers' lead group: the first 2 to 4 together);
;   fleet_together_m (a picture on the fleet only while the boards still racing are together); close_m and
;   gained_s (the 12 November numbers); the beach cam's place where a map does not say (the nearest
;   shore, or a camera boat 150 m off for the tight picture and 450 m for the wide one) and its zoom
;   range (0.8 to 30 degrees); the pull-out's growth (4 times); every picture's glide_s.
; - FROM THE LEAD'S BEACH CAMERA MEASUREMENT (drone_position.md, "The beach camera", 41 shots at
;   Sotavento): beach_eye_m 4.5 (3.5 to 5), a camera standing on the beach in front of the judges'
;   tower; one place for the heat (a map says where: a Marker3D in the group tv_shore_camera); its
;   lenses then come from the framing and the distance (the stream's: 8 to 10 degrees wide on the
;   line, 2 to 4 half close, 1 to 1.5 tight).
; - FROM THE LEAD'S DRONE MEASUREMENT (drone_position.md, lens-free): height_in_sails, the drone's
;   height in sail heights k (the sail's foot stands k sail heights below the horizon), measured for the
;   race's behind-side, ahead-side and side drones on the front, behind-side on the pack and the fleet,
;   and the three mark drones; 2.7 (the middle of the measured 2.4 to 3.0) for the other drones (a
;   choice). Each take puts the sail's middle at horizon + k x sail - sail / 2 (TvPicture.subject_share()).
;   subject_pct: the same at the medians (kept between 40 and 70), used only where there is no k: 50 for
;   the line drones and the beach cam (a choice).
; - line_drone_angle_deg (20, a choice): the line drone stands that far round from the start line's own
;   line, on the course side, so the drawn line shows (end-on it hides behind the committee boat); so
;   placed the fleet sails at it, and it takes the stream's start-phase "drone front_side line" picture
;   (5 of the nine heats' line drones were front-side, 4 side).
; - HOW A TAKE DRAWS ITS FRAMING (the game's choice, TvPicture.take_framing()): one number for the sail
;   and the horizon, within the middle half of each (between the stream's quarters): a bigger sail with a higher horizon, as a
;   drone at a steady height in sail heights that comes closer sees it.
; - Pictures the stream has that the game leaves out: the line-up graphic (55 % of the pre-start; a
;   later phase of the plan), the beach among the people (handheld), the interviews.

